WEBVTT

00:04.540 --> 00:07.210
<b>You get what you get, no complaints, okay?</b>

00:11.170 --> 00:13.580
<b>A red-tipped one means you're it.</b>

00:22.040 --> 00:24.750
<b>Yippee! It's not me!</b>

00:33.750 --> 00:35.290
<b>Not me, either!</b>

00:35.750 --> 00:36.830
<b>Nor me.</b>

00:37.080 --> 00:38.210
<b>Not me.</b>

00:38.460 --> 00:39.750
<b>Or me either.</b>

00:42.290 --> 00:44.380
<b>What? But that means...</b>

00:50.290 --> 00:51.630
<b>Yaaay!</b>

00:53.580 --> 00:54.630
<b>No...</b>

00:54.630 --> 00:56.580
<b>This can't be!</b>

00:58.880 --> 01:00.080
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

01:00.080 --> 01:03.290
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

01:03.290 --> 01:08.130
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

01:08.880 --> 01:13.960
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

01:17.880 --> 01:23.920
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora ni yume no seiza o mitsukeyou</b>

01:23.920 --> 01:32.330
<b>Kokoro o tsunaidara itsuka kanaeru yo</b>

01:40.630 --> 01:45.630
<b>Hashiridasu junbi wa dekita ka na</b>

01:46.080 --> 01:51.170
<b>Nagai michi demo nakama ga iru kara</b>

01:51.580 --> 01:55.880
<b>Fuange na kao shite mayou yori</b>

01:55.880 --> 02:00.790
<b>Tobikonde waraou</b>

02:01.380 --> 02:06.830
<b>Surechigai de kousa shita heart mo</b>

02:06.830 --> 02:09.540
<b>Kizuna e to kawaru desho</b>

02:09.540 --> 02:16.670
<b>Kasanetara hitotsu ni shite mirai o tsukamu chikara ni</b>

02:17.330 --> 02:23.170
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora e yume o zutto oikakete</b>

02:23.170 --> 02:28.630
<b>Nobashita tenohira wa akiramenai omoi o kureru</b>

02:28.630 --> 02:34.130
<b>Nanbyaku kai no chousen mo hitori nanka ja nai kara</b>

02:34.130 --> 02:41.130
<b>Daijoubu kao o agete kitto starry sky</b>

02:41.130 --> 02:43.960
<b>Kanaeru yo</b>

02:46.080 --> 02:51.040
<b>Episode 8
Hoshimori Downtime</b>

03:00.830 --> 03:05.710
<b>On a lovely day like this, nothing beats the resort.</b>

03:16.130 --> 03:17.330
<b>I'm late!</b>

03:20.330 --> 03:24.210
<b>Oh right, we've got three days of vacation.</b>

03:25.960 --> 03:27.830
<b>So you finally woke up, huh?</b>

03:27.830 --> 03:30.380
<b>Just because we don't have class
doesn't mean you should simply sleep all day.</b>

03:31.670 --> 03:35.170
<b>We finally get vacation time
but here we are on duty anyway.</b>

03:35.170 --> 03:36.710
<b>Not much we can do is there?</b>

03:37.130 --> 03:41.580
<b>Someone has to be around,
just in case any Irous show up.</b>

03:41.960 --> 03:44.420
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

03:45.080 --> 03:48.460
<b>We all pulled straws, so just put that pouty face away.</b>

03:51.630 --> 03:55.380
<b>We're about to eat breakfast,
so hurry off and wash up.</b>

03:55.710 --> 03:57.210
<b>Yeah, yeah...</b>

04:01.580 --> 04:04.500
<b>Wait, you made all this?</b>

04:04.920 --> 04:07.830
<b>Oh, it's not much really.</b>

04:07.830 --> 04:09.040
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

04:09.460 --> 04:12.420
<b>If you'd just woke me up I would have helped!</b>

04:12.420 --> 04:13.420
<b>O-oh, no, it's...</b>

04:13.420 --> 04:16.380
<b>Oh, I know. I'll make lunch instead!</b>

04:17.000 --> 04:21.210
<b>N-no, it's fine! I'll be cooking straight through vacation.</b>

04:21.210 --> 04:23.960
<b>What? I could never make you do that!</b>

04:23.960 --> 04:25.330
<b>Something's not right...</b>

04:25.330 --> 04:27.250
<b>Huh? What's up, Haruka?</b>

04:27.250 --> 04:30.130
<b>Everyone should be gone as of last night, right?</b>

04:30.130 --> 04:35.380
<b>Well, I went out to water Kurumi's plants for her...</b>

04:37.040 --> 04:39.960
<b>but someone had already gone out and done so...</b>

04:39.960 --> 04:45.630
<b>Huh? But we should be the only ones here
over the next three days.</b>

04:45.630 --> 04:48.080
<b>Exactly. But still...</b>

04:48.080 --> 04:51.210
<b>You think this might be some ghostly trickery?</b>

04:51.210 --> 04:51.920
<b>What?!</b>

04:51.920 --> 04:53.790
<b>C'mon, don't you know?</b>

04:53.790 --> 04:56.080
<b>It's one of the seven school legends...</b>

04:56.080 --> 04:58.670
<b>The tale of the ghost who wanders our halls...</b>

04:58.920 --> 05:02.040
<b>You know, I have heard of it before.</b>

05:02.130 --> 05:03.960
<b>Shinjugamine
Girls’ School</b>

05:03.000 --> 05:06.330
<b>They say if you cross paths at night it'll steal you away...</b>

05:11.290 --> 05:13.670
<b>Oh, you've gotta be kidding!</b>

05:13.670 --> 05:17.170
<b>You think ghosts would come out
with all these Irous around?</b>

05:17.170 --> 05:18.540
<b>Yeah, you're right!</b>

05:20.540 --> 05:22.420
<b>No way! No way!</b>

05:29.670 --> 05:30.880
<b>GAH!</b>

05:30.880 --> 05:34.710
<b>If we're on vacation why do we have to study like this?!</b>

05:36.460 --> 05:40.250
<b>You failed our last test though, didn't you Miki?</b>

05:38.040 --> 05:40.250
<b>Math A
Name: Miki Hoshitsuki
Make-up Test Required</b>

05:40.670 --> 05:47.040
<b>If you don't pass your make-up test, you might get
stuck in school during the Holy Tree Festival.</b>

05:47.040 --> 05:48.250
<b>What?!</b>

05:48.250 --> 05:50.130
<b>No way!</b>

05:50.880 --> 05:54.710
<b>If you want to avoid that, you need to study up.</b>

05:52.210 --> 05:55.210
<b>Math</b>

05:54.710 --> 05:56.040
<b>She's right.</b>

05:56.580 --> 06:00.710
<b>We're here with you,
so let's hurry and get this over with!</b>

06:02.630 --> 06:06.630
<b>I bet everyone else is out there having so much fun...</b>

06:08.960 --> 06:10.830
<b>S-Sadone...</b>

06:11.420 --> 06:16.130
<b>I'm right here with you, so you have nothing to fear.</b>

06:16.130 --> 06:17.250
<b>R-right...</b>

06:17.960 --> 06:23.880
<b>Th-this little ride here, it's nothing in the face of
the great Sendoin family name...</b>

06:24.130 --> 06:26.130
<b>You'll see...</b>

06:34.670 --> 06:36.080
<b>Yahoo!</b>

06:41.960 --> 06:44.250
<b>Kaede? Are you okay?</b>

06:44.630 --> 06:48.710
<b>O-of course I am. I can handle this...</b>

06:49.670 --> 06:51.380
<b>Kaede! Sadone!</b>

06:51.380 --> 06:53.080
<b>Let's ride that next!</b>

06:53.080 --> 06:54.420
<b>Ride what?</b>

07:00.790 --> 07:02.040
<b>Kaede!</b>

07:02.040 --> 07:05.330
<b>Kaede! Oh, Kaede!</b>

07:11.210 --> 07:13.750
<b>W-well, not bad, I guess.</b>

07:14.040 --> 07:16.290
<b>Of course not 'cause I picked everything out!</b>

07:17.830 --> 07:21.250
<b>Me though, I think I'd go with this.</b>

07:23.920 --> 07:26.080
<b>Right? Looks good, right?</b>

07:26.080 --> 07:27.880
<b>It's not bad, but...</b>

07:27.880 --> 07:29.380
<b>How about this?</b>

07:46.500 --> 07:48.880
<b>Enough already!</b>

07:49.040 --> 07:50.420
<b>Sorry!</b>

07:50.420 --> 07:52.380
<b>You were just so cute...</b>

07:52.670 --> 07:54.420
<b>Oh, that's good. That's good!</b>

07:54.670 --> 07:58.500
<b>These will round out my collection nicely!</b>

08:02.830 --> 08:06.460
<b>Yay! I got so many presents!</b>

08:09.710 --> 08:12.330
<b>Hey, aren't you feeling hungry yet?</b>

08:12.330 --> 08:15.170
<b>True. Let's go get lunch somewhere.</b>

08:15.500 --> 08:16.580
<b>Huh?</b>

08:18.670 --> 08:20.080
<b>Lunch!</b>

08:20.330 --> 08:21.790
<b>Lunch!</b>

08:22.130 --> 08:22.580
<b>Lunch!</b>

08:22.580 --> 08:23.500
<b>Sorry for the wait!
Lunch!</b>

08:23.500 --> 08:24.130
<b>Sorry for the wait!</b>

08:24.500 --> 08:27.250
<b>Here's my specialty jumbo fried rice!</b>

08:28.920 --> 08:31.710
<b>And for you my super jumbo fried rice!</b>

08:39.790 --> 08:42.330
<b>That quick touch flowed right into a spike.</b>

08:42.880 --> 08:46.380
<b>Keep your eyes on them; this could help us in battle.</b>

08:46.380 --> 08:47.670
<b>O-okay!</b>

08:49.460 --> 08:53.830
<b>So, uhm, Asuha? Can I ask you something?</b>

08:53.830 --> 08:55.040
<b>What is it?</b>

08:55.540 --> 08:57.830
<b>What's a "quick touch"?</b>

08:57.830 --> 09:00.880
<b>Oh, well, if this were kendo, then...</b>

09:01.920 --> 09:04.380
<b>Wow, that was quite a game!</b>

09:04.920 --> 09:07.920
<b>I only came because I was given tickets,</b>

09:07.920 --> 09:10.170
<b>but that was quite the experience.</b>

09:10.540 --> 09:15.170
<b>I know Subaru would have loved this, but...</b>

09:18.290 --> 09:19.420
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:25.170 --> 09:26.790
<b>Subtotal
Tax</b>

09:28.420 --> 09:32.750
<b>If Miki was here with us
she'd be beyond herself I'm sure.</b>

09:35.630 --> 09:37.540
<b>This is so good!</b>

09:38.500 --> 09:41.380
<b>I wish I could have brought Subaru along.</b>

09:42.630 --> 09:43.790
<b>Why?</b>

09:43.790 --> 09:47.130
<b>She always dresses so boyish,</b>

09:47.130 --> 09:50.540
<b>but I'm just sure these sort of outfits
would look great on her!</b>

09:55.790 --> 09:57.630
<b>Oh my... Oh, yes!</b>

09:58.170 --> 10:00.710
<b>Excuse me, miss...?</b>

10:01.000 --> 10:05.000
<b>Kaede Sendoin (2nd Year JH)
Birthday: December 24th
Sign: Capricorn
Blood Type: A
Measurements: 78/55/76
Height: 154cm
Weight: 42kg
Hobby: Touring Art Museums
Dream Job: Artist
Favorite Food: Instant ramen
Ideal Downtime: Horseback riding</b>

10:05.080 --> 10:09.040
<b>Sadone (1st Year JH)
Birthday: December 7th
Sign: Sagittarius
Blood Type: ?
Measurements: 85/54/77
Height: 147cm
Weight: 39kg
Hobby: Knitting
Favorite Food: Chocolate
Future Dream: To have a family
Ideal Downtime: Fixing old stuffed animals</b>

10:26.500 --> 10:29.790
<b>It's kinda weird being at an empty school.</b>

10:30.080 --> 10:31.500
<b>Indeed.</b>

10:31.500 --> 10:34.750
<b>It's like we're the only ones left in the world.</b>

10:36.130 --> 10:37.790
<b>Hrmphh...</b>

10:43.170 --> 10:46.420
<b>Hey, so why did you want to come out here anyway?</b>

10:49.170 --> 10:52.790
<b>Actually, there's something
I've wanted to do for a while now!</b>

11:10.540 --> 11:14.500
<b>I must say, that was most pleasant.</b>

11:14.500 --> 11:17.830
<b>I wish we could have brought Haruka
and the others along with us, too.</b>

11:18.170 --> 11:22.710
<b>Miki and Subaru probably would
have dozed off, though.</b>

11:44.250 --> 11:46.750
<b>YOKONA-I X
3 types of live bacteria
leave you feeling better fast!!
For headaches, nausea, and diziness
brought on by motion sickness</b>

11:45.040 --> 11:48.000
<b>Wow, we rode on so much stuff and it was so much fun!</b>

11:48.000 --> 11:48.960
<b>Yeah!</b>

11:50.710 --> 11:53.130
<b>Yes, oh yes...</b>

11:53.500 --> 11:54.420
<b>But...</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:59.540
<b>It would have been more fun if everyone was with us.</b>

12:03.250 --> 12:06.250
<b>Yes, you are undoubtedly right.</b>

12:21.420 --> 12:24.000
<b>I wonder what everyone is up to right about now?</b>

12:24.000 --> 12:28.170
<b>Having lots of fun and enjoying their vacations, I bet.</b>

12:28.460 --> 12:30.080
<b>Without a doubt.</b>

12:32.330 --> 12:34.540
<b>Yakitori</b>

12:35.250 --> 12:37.920
<b>Oh, how I've lived for this very moment!</b>

12:38.670 --> 12:40.790
<b>Don't I know it!</b>

12:44.460 --> 12:51.080
<b>But do ya really think izza good idea
leavin' 'em at school alone?</b>

12:52.250 --> 12:54.080
<b>Don't sweat it.</b>

12:54.080 --> 12:56.330
<b>They can handle themselves.</b>

12:56.750 --> 12:58.580
<b>We teachers are people too.</b>

12:58.580 --> 13:00.920
<b>We gotta rest when we can, yeah?</b>

13:03.500 --> 13:05.710
<b>Oh, don't you know it!</b>

13:06.580 --> 13:07.790
<b>Now then...</b>

13:11.130 --> 13:14.500
<b>Let's drink the night away, then!</b>

13:14.500 --> 13:15.920
<b>Oh yeah!</b>

13:19.130 --> 13:21.130
<b>Miki, wake up.</b>

13:21.420 --> 13:22.880
<b>Come on, wake up.</b>

13:23.460 --> 13:25.170
<b>What is it?</b>

13:25.170 --> 13:26.960
<b>Breakfast already?</b>

13:28.210 --> 13:29.790
<b>No, but...</b>

13:31.710 --> 13:33.380
<b>What's wrong?</b>

13:34.170 --> 13:36.960
<b>I just went to go get some water and...</b>

13:37.210 --> 13:40.540
<b>When I walked by Asuha's room...</b>

13:42.170 --> 13:43.880
<b>HS 3rd Year Team</b>

13:43.960 --> 13:46.790
<b>There was this weird rumbling sound
coming from inside.</b>

13:46.790 --> 13:50.290
<b>Huh? But we're the only ones here, right?</b>

13:50.670 --> 13:53.540
<b>Yeah, that's why it seemed so odd.</b>

13:54.210 --> 13:56.580
<b>Do you think it could be...</b>

13:56.580 --> 13:57.920
<b>A burglar?!</b>

13:59.540 --> 14:01.540
<b>Why won't you turn on the lights?</b>

14:01.540 --> 14:04.830
<b>Because if we did they'd know we're coming!</b>

14:05.460 --> 14:10.170
<b>Before they even realize what's going on
I'm gonna pan 'em one with this sock...</b>

14:12.500 --> 14:14.040
<b>H-here goes...</b>

14:14.040 --> 14:15.460
<b>O-okay...</b>

14:15.460 --> 14:16.460
<b>Wait!</b>

14:16.830 --> 14:19.920
<b>Do you think it's really a burglar in there?</b>

14:20.330 --> 14:22.460
<b>If not, then who is it?</b>

14:22.460 --> 14:25.380
<b>Maybe it might be... a ghost?</b>

14:25.380 --> 14:26.170
<b>Huh?</b>

14:26.500 --> 14:28.420
<b>Like we talked about this morning!</b>

14:28.420 --> 14:30.790
<b>The ghost from the seven school legends!</b>

14:31.250 --> 14:33.000
<b>Wh-what are you trying to say?</b>

14:33.000 --> 14:34.920
<b>Th-that's all nonsense!</b>

14:34.920 --> 14:37.170
<b>Y-yeah! Ghosts don't exist...</b>

14:37.880 --> 14:39.750
<b>Let's just leave it be!</b>

14:39.750 --> 14:40.710
<b>We can't!</b>

14:40.710 --> 14:41.710
<b>Why not?</b>

14:41.710 --> 14:48.710
<b>I-if we don't at least check we're going to be
sitting around all night worrying about ghosts.</b>

14:48.710 --> 14:53.460
<b>True. We're better off finding out now
than never knowing the truth.</b>

14:53.460 --> 14:57.080
<b>It's a 50/50 chance we find either
a burglar or a ghost, after all.</b>

14:57.330 --> 14:59.460
<b>Okay then. Here goes.</b>

15:00.080 --> 15:01.080
<b>W-wait!</b>

15:01.080 --> 15:03.250
<b>Burglar! Prepare yourself!</b>

15:03.790 --> 15:04.670
<b>Huh?</b>

15:05.040 --> 15:05.960
<b>Huh?</b>

15:06.290 --> 15:10.210
<b>What? So you all thought I was some thief?</b>

15:10.210 --> 15:14.710
<b>Well, we were also half convinced you were a ghost...</b>

15:14.710 --> 15:16.630
<b>That's even worse...</b>

15:17.130 --> 15:18.630
<b>I'm really sorry...</b>

15:18.830 --> 15:22.790
<b>But Anko, you said you were
going on a trip for vacation.</b>

15:23.000 --> 15:24.420
<b>I did!</b>

15:24.420 --> 15:25.500
<b>Using this!</b>

15:25.500 --> 15:26.540
<b>Huh?</b>

15:26.540 --> 15:28.630
<b>So you've been cooped up in here this whole time?</b>

15:28.880 --> 15:32.750
<b>Yup! I was enjoying a nice virtual vacation.</b>

15:32.750 --> 15:38.130
<b>Wow! We never even realized you were in here today!</b>

15:38.420 --> 15:40.920
<b>You're really a next-level hermit...</b>

15:40.920 --> 15:42.290
<b>Pretty much.</b>

15:42.290 --> 15:47.130
<b>So, were you the one who
watered the flowers this morning?</b>

15:47.420 --> 15:49.330
<b>Huh? What are you talking about?</b>

15:49.580 --> 15:51.790
<b>I didn't water any flowers.</b>

15:52.130 --> 15:53.210
<b>Huh...?</b>

16:00.920 --> 16:02.000
<b>Oh...</b>

16:05.000 --> 16:06.830
<b>So it was you all along, Misaki.</b>

16:07.540 --> 16:09.460
<b>You've been watering the flowers.</b>

16:10.170 --> 16:11.920
<b>Y-yeah.</b>

16:14.290 --> 16:17.670
<b>I promised Kurumi I would.</b>

16:24.250 --> 16:28.330
<b>Who would have thought anyone but me
would have hung around.</b>

16:28.790 --> 16:32.130
<b>But we didn't even catch
a glimpse of you the whole time.</b>

16:32.130 --> 16:33.630
<b>Where were you?</b>

16:33.630 --> 16:34.960
<b>I was training.</b>

16:35.250 --> 16:37.880
<b>It was good practice for a sneaking mission.</b>

16:37.880 --> 16:39.670
<b>How so?</b>

16:39.880 --> 16:42.080
<b>She was snooping around.</b>

16:42.080 --> 16:43.080
<b>Oh...</b>

16:43.290 --> 16:49.670
<b>You mean, you were hiding and
sneaking around the whole dorm?</b>

16:50.420 --> 16:53.960
<b>You weren't spying on us, were you?</b>

16:53.960 --> 16:54.790
<b>Huh?</b>

16:54.790 --> 16:58.920
<b>Not just that, but maybe she was
up to something naughty!</b>

16:58.920 --> 17:00.250
<b>Something naughty?</b>

17:00.880 --> 17:02.460
<b>Stop kidding yourselves!</b>

17:03.080 --> 17:05.290
<b>I didn’t really...</b>

17:52.670 --> 17:54.250
<b>do anything...</b>

18:03.960 --> 18:05.210
<b>Okay, cut!</b>

18:12.290 --> 18:14.830
<b>What? They're calling off filming today?</b>

18:14.830 --> 18:21.330
<b>The director said they don't like the shape of
that mountain so they want to find another location...</b>

18:21.330 --> 18:27.960
<b>I'm sorry for the trouble, but we'll contact your studio
once we've got a schedule worked out again.</b>

18:32.710 --> 18:34.420
<b>Well imagine that.</b>

18:34.420 --> 18:37.250
<b>After we had them switch up their schedule
so much already.</b>

18:38.040 --> 18:41.420
<b>Looks like we have a day to ourselves.
What should we do?</b>

18:43.130 --> 18:45.920
<b>Now now, do you even have to ask?</b>

18:52.380 --> 18:53.500
<b>Huh?</b>

18:53.500 --> 18:54.880
<b>No! Wait!</b>

18:55.330 --> 18:59.330
<b>No can do. Three strikes and you're out.</b>

19:03.290 --> 19:05.580
<b>Gah! I can't take this!</b>

19:06.080 --> 19:10.960
<b>If I study any more, numbers are just gonna
start pouring out of my ears!</b>

19:11.380 --> 19:13.710
<b>Let's stop here for today, then.</b>

19:14.080 --> 19:16.080
<b>Must be nice to be a teacher.</b>

19:16.080 --> 19:16.920
<b>Huh?</b>

19:16.920 --> 19:22.130
<b>They just put all the studying on us.
Must be a piece of cake for them.</b>

19:22.420 --> 19:23.750
<b>That's not true.</b>

19:25.540 --> 19:29.170
<b>While I was sneaking around
I spotted our teacher a number of times.</b>

19:30.380 --> 19:34.000
<b>He was working straight through the vacation.</b>

19:35.380 --> 19:41.580
<b>He seemed especially focused on putting together
a curriculum that could balance out with our training.</b>

19:44.790 --> 19:50.420
<b>I guess he's thinking about us
in ways we normally can't see, huh.</b>

19:51.080 --> 19:52.420
<b>I'm sure he is.</b>

19:52.830 --> 19:55.040
<b>I'm gonna thank him!</b>

19:55.040 --> 19:55.960
<b>Huh?</b>

19:55.960 --> 19:58.880
<b>I'll bake him a nice thank you cake!</b>

19:58.880 --> 19:59.920
<b>WHAT?!</b>

19:59.920 --> 20:01.420
<b>Oh, what a great idea!</b>

20:01.420 --> 20:02.630
<b>Hey, wait...</b>

20:02.630 --> 20:05.040
<b>In that case, let me help.</b>

20:05.040 --> 20:05.920
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:05.920 --> 20:09.500
<b>Misaki have you ever baked before?</b>

20:09.500 --> 20:10.380
<b>Nope.</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:15.670
<b>But I've heard that cooking is
more about heart than skill.</b>

20:15.670 --> 20:17.960
<b>So I think I could still pull something off.</b>

20:18.080 --> 20:21.540
<b>Okay then. Me and Subaru will be your taste testers.</b>

20:21.540 --> 20:22.830
<b>Nooooo!</b>

20:24.130 --> 20:26.500
<b>Hmm. I guess that should do it.</b>

20:28.460 --> 20:29.500
<b>Huh?</b>

20:29.830 --> 20:31.960
<b>An emergency mail from Tsubuzaki?!</b>

20:32.330 --> 20:34.080
<b>What is it? What's-</b>

20:34.080 --> 20:35.290
<b>...wrong?</b>

20:36.040 --> 20:37.420
<b>Why...?</b>

20:37.420 --> 20:39.920
<b>How could this happen?</b>

20:40.710 --> 20:42.250
<b>Sir...!</b>

20:42.500 --> 20:43.500
<b>Huh?</b>

20:45.420 --> 20:46.420
<b>Oh...</b>

20:46.420 --> 20:48.130
<b>So you were baking a cake for me?</b>

20:48.380 --> 20:51.130
<b>But it all went wrong...</b>

20:52.130 --> 20:53.630
<b>What gives?</b>

20:53.630 --> 20:55.830
<b>What's with the long faces?</b>

20:55.830 --> 20:59.330
<b>Kanon! And Shiho too!</b>

21:00.080 --> 21:03.500
<b>Our shoot got cancelled
so we came by to see everyone.</b>

21:03.500 --> 21:05.290
<b>And it looks like we timed it just right, huh?</b>

21:05.290 --> 21:06.290
<b>Hmm?</b>

21:16.420 --> 21:20.130
<b>But why? You shouldn't be back until tomorrow.</b>

21:20.790 --> 21:24.130
<b>We were just a bit worried about you all.</b>

21:24.710 --> 21:27.460
<b>It's more fun when we're all together anyway!</b>

21:28.710 --> 21:30.960
<b>Sounds like we all felt the same way.</b>

21:33.000 --> 21:35.170
<b>Welcome back everyone!</b>

21:37.630 --> 21:39.500
<b>Well, I didn't get a cake, but...</b>

21:39.500 --> 21:40.500
<b>Mimi! Where did you go?</b>

21:40.500 --> 21:41.540
<b>C'mon, you. Come and join us.
Mimi! Where did you go?</b>

21:41.540 --> 21:42.920
<b>C'mon, you. Come and join us.
I went out shopping with Nozomi and Urara!</b>

21:42.920 --> 21:44.880
<b>Wha? No, I...
I went out shopping with Nozomi and Urara!</b>

21:44.880 --> 21:46.710
<b>Oh, come on.
I went out shopping with Nozomi and Urara!</b>

21:46.710 --> 21:48.460
<b>Aww, I'm so jealous!</b>

21:48.460 --> 21:49.670
<b>But still...</b>

21:49.830 --> 21:51.670
<b>Well, what did you get?</b>

21:51.670 --> 21:53.580
<b>Well, I got this nice...</b>

22:12.500 --> 22:18.960
<b>Mawatteru hazu demo tomatteru ki ga shite</b>

22:18.960 --> 22:25.290
<b>Hitori de nayande wakatteru furi</b>

22:25.290 --> 22:31.710
<b>Meimetsu no hate ni tozakaru risou o</b>

22:31.710 --> 22:37.500
<b>Hitomi ni utsushite hashiraseta noise</b>

22:37.500 --> 22:44.040
<b>Kodoku na rondeau ni torawareru ishi</b>

22:44.290 --> 22:47.710
<b>Kazashitara nukedashite</b>

22:47.710 --> 22:53.080
<b>Tomoni kanademashou saa</b>

22:53.210 --> 23:00.040
<b>Dare demo nai kimeru no wa jibun jishin dakara</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:06.210
<b>Seikai mo machigai mo "rashisa" ni kawatteku</b>

23:06.210 --> 23:13.000
<b>Kasanariai itsu no hi ka kanau to shinjitara</b>

23:13.000 --> 23:21.830
<b>Shiroi fumen kakidasu kono yo ni hitotsu dake no</b>

23:22.080 --> 23:25.080
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:30.130 --> 23:33.420
<b>Mimicchi, what are you doing with that red hood on?</b>

23:33.420 --> 23:36.040
<b>Maybe she's practicing for the upcoming play?</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:37.670
<b>Next Episode: "Holy Tree Festival"!</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.040
<b>Next Episode
Holy Tree Festival
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:37.670 --> 23:40.500
<b>Why do I have to play the turtle?!</b>
